      "quote": "10(37%) did not include body mass index (BMI) as an outcome",
      "reason": "The review does not distinguish exclusion because outcomes were not measured from exclusion because outcome results were not reported; the stated exclusion ('did not include BMI as an outcome') conflates the two."
